unartistic:
音标：/.ʌnɑ:'tistik/
中：a. 非艺术的, 无艺术欣赏力的
英：s lacking aesthetic sensibility;

unblest:
中：a. 不受天福的, 无福的, 不受祝福的, 邪恶的, 被诅咒的, 倒霉的, 不幸的
英：a. Not blest; excluded from benediction; hence, accursed;
   wretched.

uncharm:
中：去魔
英：v. t. To release from a charm, fascination, or secret power;
   to disenchant.

under-the-counter:
音标：/'ʌndәðә'kauntә/
中：a. 私下出售的, 开后门的, 暗中成交的, 违法的, 禁止的
英：s. done or sold illicitly and secretly;

unequalness:
中：n. unequal的变形
英：n. The quality or state of being unequal; inequality;
   unevenness.

unrested:
音标：/ʌn'rest/
中：n. 不宁, 不安；焦虑；动乱, 不安, 骚动
英：s not rested or refreshed;

uterogestation:
中：[医] 子宫妊娠; 足月妊娠
英：n. Gestation in the womb from conception to birth;
   pregnancy.

utterness:
中：n. utter的变形
英：n. The quality or state of being utter, or extreme;
   extremity; utmost; uttermost.
